                  "https://developers.stellar.org/docs/learn/encyclopedia/security"
                ],
                "remediation": "Use a constant literal of at most nine characters such as `symbol_short!(\"transfer\")`, or use `Symbol::new(&env, value)` for longer or dynamic values. Never derive a storage key directly from caller input; map it through an allowlist of known keys.",
                "severity": "medium"
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unsafe symbol_short key"
