                "remediation": "Validate the address before the cross-contract call. Use a documented helper such as `validate_address`, compare against an address stored at configuration time, or reject addresses that are not on an explicit allowlist. Validate on every path, before the call.",
                "severity": "medium"
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Cross-contract call with an unvalidated address argument"
